1.1.0
Much lighter on your world: the mod searched every entity in the world for survivors and animals 30 times a second, and now does it once every half second, only while you are within 60 m of a door that a survivor or an animal could open, so survivors walking up to a door still open it right away. Doors are now looked for every 5 seconds and secret pieces every 30 seconds (both were every 2.5 seconds), so a secret door, shelf, floor or stair placed in your base starts working within 30 seconds. The build camera now opens a door taller than the Height Reach anywhere up to the top of its doorway, for example the 6 m Round Ancient Door, which used to open only near its foot; players, survivors and animals keep the plain Height Reach, so standing on a floor above a tall door does not open it.

1.0.0
First release.
